        {
            "Id": 34026502,
            "EpisodeType": 5,
            "CharacterId": 106,
            "SpeakerName": "",
            "Description": "睡眠质量真的很重要呢。",
            "Order": 2
        },
        {
            "Id": 34026503,
            "EpisodeType": 5,
            "CharacterId": 105,
            "SpeakerName": "",
            "Description": "哦……怎么突然说这个？流石。/n一大早出了宿舍……现在又在房间里写作业？",
